FX parameter mappings, Graphic 9 wire order, Cab/IR curves and per-preset FX value cache.
From AJs-Creations/nano-cortex-editor#31 by itsbreaded (calibrated against the official iOS app on NanOS 2.2.1),
ported onto upstream V1.12.1. Upstream has none of it yet; its own "[123] q" fix covers part of Parametric 3.
Kept for display only: saved values never become an effect's Original or count as known.
One merge choice: the three EQ models' Output is -20..+20 dB as in #31 (upstream says -12..+12).

